  "title": "Pub Peanut Muffins",
  "description": "What is better than beer and peanuts? Having the perfect combination in a sweet muffin! For extra yummy flavor, serve warm with peanut butter or nut butter spread.",
  "authors": [
    "ColleenMick"
  ],
